Upstream-Name: OpenWEC
Upstream-Contact: CEA-SEC <https://github.com/cea-sec/openwec>
Source: https://github.com/cea-sec/openwec
Comment:
 This package contains OpenWEC built from upstream commit
 @UPSTREAM_COMMIT@ without source changes. OpenWEC runs as a separate
 process (openwecd) and is not linked into AdMng Watchdog.
 .
 Complete corresponding source: the release of AD_MNG that ships this package
 carries, as a release asset, admng-openwec-@VERSION_NOREV@-source.tar.xz – the
 upstream tree of that commit, every Rust crate it is built from (cargo vendor,
 Cargo.lock as committed upstream) and the build recipe (packaging/admng-openwec
 and tools/packaging/build-openwec-deb.sh of AD_MNG). The same tarball is
 available on request from the maintainer for at least three years after the
 last distribution of this package.

